id: will-of-nine-lives
name: Will of Nine Lives
talentCategory: racial
race: neko-majin
prerequisites: Neko Majin Race
description: >
  Like a wily tomcat on the run, you are incredibly difficult to put down for good.
text: >
  Will of Nine Lives: Like a wily tomcat on the run, you are incredibly difficult to put down for good.
  –Prerequisites: Neko Majin Race
  (1)-[Passive]: While you have an Integrated Majin-Dama, increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  (2)-[Triggered]: If you use a Healing Surge during your turn, you may stop benefiting from the effects of any Integrated Majin-Dama until the start of your next turn. If you do, increase the amount of Life Points regained by your Surgency.
  (3)-[Triggered/Threshold, 1/Encounter]: If you have an Integrated Majin-Dama, use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
if (hasIntegratedDama) {
    steadfast.dice += 1;
}
# (2) A Healing Surge on your turn: asked - your Active Integrated Majin-Dama made Inactive till the start of your next turn (Active again
# then), your Surgency once more on it (chat.mjs takeSurge; combat.mjs beginTurn).
allow nineLives.surge;

# (3) Knocked through a Health Threshold with an Integrated Majin-Dama: on its card, never Automatic, once an Encounter - a Healing Surge
# out of sequence.
[triggered/threshold, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 3]
requires hasIntegratedDama;
lionsHeart();
